+      # -----------------------------------------------------------------
+      # Step: User-template derivation gate (PLAN-169 wave-s330-F, ADR-197)
+      #
+      # `templates/settings/settings.user.json` is DERIVED from
+      # `settings.base.json` by the declared subtraction in its own
+      # `_derivation` key — never a hand-maintained second copy. That is
+      # the cure for the defect the wave measured: the old user template
+      # was a manual copy frozen at 9777a8d whose own `_comment` asserted
+      # a hook count and a byte-parity that nothing read, and both had
+      # rotted (26 basenames missing, a hand-narrowed matcher, a dropped
+      # second registration). A numeral in JSON prose is watched by
+      # nothing.
+      #
+      # `--check` re-derives the template from base + spec in memory and
+      # byte-diffs it against the committed file — the same
+      # regen-and-diff shape as the two idempotency steps above. The
+      # pytest suite already covers this (`.claude/scripts/tests/` IS
+      # collected by CI), so this step is not the only coverage; it
+      # exists because a dedicated step names the failure and prints the
