+      # covers this step like every other. Exit contract: 0 in-sync /
+      # 1 drift / 2 unusable input (missing file, missing `_derivation`)
+      # — ANY non-zero fails this step, fail-closed by design: a spec the
+      # generator cannot read is not a pass.
